{"@context":"https://schema.org","@type":"Article","@id":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24791","headline":"七老会诗 · 张浑","name":"七老会诗","inLanguage":"zh-Hans","text":"幽亭春尽共爲欢，印绶居身是大官。\n遁迹岂劳登远岫，垂丝何必坐谿磻。\n诗联七韵犹应易，酒饮三杯未觉难。\n每况襟怀同宴会，共将心事比波澜。\n风吹野柳垂罗带，日照庭花落绮纨。\n此席不烦铺锦帐，斯筵堪作画图看。","author":{"@type":"Person","name":"张浑","nationality":"唐"},"publisher":{"@type":"Organization","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"image":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/og/open_24791.png","mainEntityOfPage":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/poem.html?id=open_24791","isPartOf":{"@type":"WebSite","name":"石湖诗社","url":"https://tianbuyu-wwx.github.io/Tang-Poetry/"},"genre":"七言古诗","abstract":"收录于https://github.com/chinese-poetry/chinese-poetry"}